From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8350-b2q: fast wireless charging

Stock's CV and full foreign object detection gains (fod_list pad_0x00)
and its input limits on a Samsung fast wireless pad: 600 mA at 10 V
(HV_WIRELESS), 500 mA until then (PREPARE_WIRELESS_HV), and 5.5 V from
38.5 C of battery to 37.5 C.

The wireless charging limit at the battery's first trip was stock's
wpc_high_temp, 37 C back at 35 C, which is for WC 2.0 pads only. Every
other pad gets non_wc20_wpc_high_temp, 38.5 C back at 37.5 C
(sec_bat_check_wpc_temp()); the trip is that now.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
index 27ee9ca..06c1aab 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
@@ -423,11 +423,24 @@
 			pinctrl-0 = <&wpc_det_state &mfc_int_state &wpc_en_state>;
 			pinctrl-names = "default";
 
-			/* stock fod_list pad_0x00 cc */
+			/* stock fod_list pad_0x00 cc, cv and full */
 			idt,fod = /bits/ 8 <0x96 0x3e 0x8e 0x37 0x96 0x2e
 					    0x96 0x31 0xaa 0x03 0x9c 0x42>;
+			idt,fod-cv = /bits/ 8 <0x96 0x5c 0x8e 0x55 0x96 0x4c
+					       0x96 0x4f 0xaa 0x21 0x9c 0x60>;
+			idt,fod-full = /bits/ 8 <0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f
+						 0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f 0xff 0x7f>;
 			/* cable-info WIRELESS (Qi BPP, PMA, stands): 800 mA in */
 			idt,bpp-input-current-microamp = <800000>;
+			/*
+			 * HV_WIRELESS (Samsung fast wireless, 10 V): 600 mA;
+			 * PREPARE_WIRELESS_HV, until 10 V: 500 mA
+			 */
+			idt,hv-input-current-microamp = <600000>;
+			idt,hv-prepare-input-current-microamp = <500000>;
+			/* non_wc20_wpc_high_temp: 5.5 V at 38.5 C, 10 V again at 37.5 */
+			idt,hv-hot-millicelsius = <38500>;
+			idt,hv-hot-recovery-millicelsius = <37500>;
 
 			/* the charger's UNO boost powers it to transmit */
 			uno-supply = <&max77705_uno>;
@@ -1194,7 +1207,8 @@
  * caps in maxim,thermal-*-current-limits-microamp, level 3 stops charging.
  *
  * batt-thermal, wpc_thm (stock's battery temperature):
- *   37 C (wpc_high_temp, back at 35): wireless level 1, 600 mA in, 1000 mA
+ *   38.5 C (non_wc20_wpc_high_temp, back at 37.5): wireless level 1, 600 mA
+ *   in, 1000 mA (wpc_high_temp, 37/35, is for WC 2.0 pads, not supported)
  *   42 C (normal_warm_thresh): both level 2, 1050 mA wired, 650 mA wireless
  *   50 C (warm_overheat_thresh): both stop
  * chg-thermal, chg_thm:
@@ -1218,8 +1232,8 @@
 
 			trips {
 				batt_hot: batt-hot {
-					temperature = <37000>;
-					hysteresis = <2000>;
+					temperature = <38500>;
+					hysteresis = <1000>;
 					type = "passive";
 				};
 
